<section class="py-16 bg-surface border-b border-slate-100">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <span class="badge-clinical bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 mb-2">Physician Endorsed</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Clinical Evidence in Practice</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-2">What board-certified dermatologists and patients report after 14 days of physiological barrier therapy.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Review 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-500 mb-3">
          {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] fill-current">star</span>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed flex-1 italic">
          "The CeraRepair Emulsion is one of the few formulations I recommend unconditionally to patients with acute retinol burn and compromised stratum corneum. It delivers rapid, measurable TEWL reduction without clogging follicles."
        </p>
        <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">SL</div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Dr. Sarah Lin, MD, FAAD</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Board-Certified Dermatologist, NYC</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-500 mb-3">
          {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] fill-current">star</span>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed flex-1 italic">
          "After 5 years of battling cystic acne and redness from overly aggressive benzoyl peroxide scrubs, the 3-step DermaPure regimen repaired my barrier in 10 days. My face finally feels calm and hydrated."
        </p>
        <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">EM</div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Elena M. <span class="text-emerald-700 font-semibold text-[10px]">Verified Patient</span></h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Using Barrier Protocol for 6 Months</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-500 mb-3">
          {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] fill-current">star</span>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed flex-1 italic">
          "The stability of their 15% Vitamin C formulation is exceptional. Formulated at pH 2.8 with ferulic acid, it provides legitimate photoprotection without the greasy residue common in consumer grade serums."
        </p>
        <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">MV</div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Dr. Marcus Vance, MD</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Director of Clinical Photobiology</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Testimonials",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Testimonials"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
